  InitializationCommands "%% NPC.\nfc = 10e3;\nTs = 1/fc;\nVdc = 24;\nRp = 1e-"
"3;\n\n%% Motor.\npp = 2;\nRs = 0.82;\nLs = 2.5e-3;\nphi = 0.1041893/(2*pi);\n"
"J = 7.48e-6;\nF = 1e-4;\n\n%% Current Control.\ntau = Ls/Rs;\nK0 = Vdc/Rs;\n"
"\nwn = 450*2*pi;\nxi = 5;\n\nTi = (2*xi)/wn;\nKp = (wn*wn*tau*Ti)/K0;\nKi = K"
"p/Ti;\n\n%% Speed Control. \nfp = 10;\n\nws = 2*pi*1;\nxs = 1.5;\nTi = (2*xs)"
"/ws;\n\nKp_s = (ws^2*Ti)/(2*pi*fp);\nKi_s = Kp_s/Ti;\n\n%% CHB. \nn = 3;"
